          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रंगोली — raṅgolī — \"a rangoli, a coloured pattern on the floor\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मीरा ने आँगन में रंगोली बनाई। Mīrā ne āṁgan meṁ raṅgolī banāī. Mira made a rangoli in the courtyard."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रंगोली (raṅgolī) is probably built on रंग, colour, from Sanskrit raṅga (Monier-Williams); the rest of the word is not settled. It is drawn on the floor at the door for a festival."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
